---
apiVersion: framework.prompt/v1
id: demo.complex.high.advanced
name: High Complexity Advanced Demo
extends: demo.base.example
description: Comprehensive demonstration of all prompt system features including complex inheritance, conditional logic, provider integration, and advanced variable usage

tags:
  paradigm: [react, pipeline, htn, goalcon, blackboard, rewoo]
  agent: [euclo, framework, react, pipeline]
  domain: [demo, testing, validation, advanced, complex]
  kind: task
  stability: experimental

variables:
  user_task:
    default: "(no task specified)"
  workspace_language:
    default: "the workspace language"
  project_name:
    default: "advanced-demo-project"
  debug_mode:
    default: "false"
  max_iterations:
    default: "5"
  timeout_setting:
    default: "60"
  retry_count:
    default: "3"
  enable_advanced_features:
    default: "true"
  enable_experimental_mode:
    default: "false"
  enable_detailed_logging:
    default: "false"
  api_endpoint:
    default: "https://api.advanced.example.com/v2"
  database_url:
    default: "postgresql://localhost:5432/advanced_demo"
  cache_endpoint:
    default: "redis://localhost:6379"
  auth_token:
    default: "(no token provided)"
  security_context:
    default: "standard"
  encryption_key:
    default: "(no key provided)"
  max_concurrent_operations:
    default: "10"
  memory_limit_mb:
    default: "2048"
  cpu_quota:
    default: "50"
  business_domain:
    default: "enterprise"
  compliance_level:
    default: "strict"
  audit_required:
    default: "true"

requires_providers:
  - react.tools
  - react.memory
  - react.history
  - pipeline.stage_outputs
  - pipeline.task_instruction
  - htn.decomposition
  - htn.task_graph
  - goalcon.goal_planning
  - goalcon.goal_execution
  - blackboard.knowledge_base
  - blackboard.control_strategy
  - rewoo.planning
  - rewoo.execution
  - euclo.recipe_step_context
  - euclo.recipe_metadata
  - framework.classification_signals
  - framework.capability_catalog
  - framework.validation.input
  - framework.validation.safety
  - framework.error.recovery
  - framework.tool.formatting
  - demo.advanced_provider
  - demo.context_provider
  - demo.state_provider
  - demo.analytics_provider

framework_critical: false
---

# Advanced System Persona
~ kind: persona
~ order: early
~ locked: true

You are an advanced demonstration assistant for the Relurpify framework version {framework_version}. You operate in a {base_context} with {security_level} security level, working within the {business_domain} domain at {compliance_level} compliance level.

Current operational context:
- Project: {project_name}
- Language: {workspace_language}
- Environment: {base_context}
- Security: {security_context}
- Debug mode: {debug_mode}
- Advanced features: {enable_advanced_features}
- Experimental mode: {enable_experimental_mode}
- Detailed logging: {enable_detailed_logging}

# Configuration Overview
~ kind: task
~ order: 15
~ when: enable_advanced_features == "true"

## System Configuration
- API Endpoint: {api_endpoint}
- Database: {database_url}
- Cache: {cache_endpoint}
- Timeout: {timeout_setting}s
- Max iterations: {max_iterations}
- Retry count: {retry_count}

## Performance Settings
- Max concurrent: {max_concurrent_operations}
- Memory limit: {memory_limit_mb}MB
- CPU quota: {cpu_quota}%

## Security Context
- Auth token: {auth_token}
- Encryption: {encryption_key}
- Audit required: {audit_required}

# Multi-Paradigm Task Analysis
~ kind: task
~ order: 20
~ when: user_task != "(no task specified)"

Primary task: "{user_task}"

This task will be analyzed using multiple paradigms:
- **React**: Sequential reasoning and action
- **Pipeline**: Stage-based processing
- **HTN**: Hierarchical task decomposition
- **GoalCon**: Goal-oriented planning
- **Blackboard**: Knowledge-based reasoning
- **ReWOO**: Planning and execution

# React Paradigm Integration
~ kind: capability
~ order: 25
~ from: provider
~ provider: react.tools
~ when: "react" in tags.paradigm

# React Memory Context
~ kind: task
~ order: 26
~ from: provider
~ provider: react.memory
~ when: "react" in tags.paradigm && enable_detailed_logging == "true"

# React History
~ kind: task
~ order: 27
~ from: provider
~ provider: react.history
~ when: "react" in tags.paradigm && debug_mode == "true"

# Pipeline Paradigm Integration
~ kind: capability
~ order: 30
~ from: provider
~ provider: pipeline.stage_outputs
~ when: "pipeline" in tags.paradigm

# Pipeline Task Instructions
~ kind: task
~ order: 31
~ from: provider
~ provider: pipeline.task_instruction
~ when: "pipeline" in tags.paradigm

# HTN Paradigm Integration
~ kind: capability
~ order: 35
~ from: provider
~ provider: htn.decomposition
~ when: "htn" in tags.paradigm

# HTN Task Graph
~ kind: task
~ order: 36
~ from: provider
~ provider: htn.task_graph
~ when: "htn" in tags.paradigm && enable_advanced_features == "true"

# GoalCon Paradigm Integration
~ kind: capability
~ order: 40
~ from: provider
~ provider: goalcon.goal_planning
~ when: "goalcon" in tags.paradigm

# GoalCon Execution
~ kind: task
~ order: 41
~ from: provider
~ provider: goalcon.goal_execution
~ when: "goalcon" in tags.paradigm && max_iterations > 3

# Blackboard Paradigm Integration
~ kind: capability
~ order: 45
~ from: provider
~ provider: blackboard.knowledge_base
~ when: "blackboard" in tags.paradigm

# Blackboard Control Strategy
~ kind: task
~ order: 46
~ from: provider
~ provider: blackboard.control_strategy
~ when: "blackboard" in tags.paradigm && debug_mode == "true"

# ReWOO Paradigm Integration
~ kind: capability
~ order: 50
~ from: provider
~ provider: rewoo.planning
~ when: "rewoo" in tags.paradigm

# ReWOO Execution
~ kind: task
~ order: 51
~ from: provider
~ provider: rewoo.execution
~ when: "rewoo" in tags.paradigm && enable_experimental_mode == "true"

# Euclo Recipe Context
~ kind: task
~ order: 55
~ from: provider
~ provider: euclo.recipe_step_context
~ when: "euclo" in tags.agent && euclo.has_captures

# Euclo Recipe Metadata
~ kind: task
~ order: 56
~ from: provider
~ provider: euclo.recipe_metadata
~ when: "euclo" in tags.agent && enable_detailed_logging == "true"

# Framework Classification Signals
~ kind: capability
~ order: 60
~ from: provider
~ provider: framework.classification_signals
~ when: framework.classification_enabled

# Framework Capability Catalog
~ kind: capability
~ order: 61
~ from: provider
~ provider: framework.capability_catalog
~ when: enable_advanced_features == "true"

# Input Validation
~ kind: constraint
~ order: 65
~ from: provider
~ provider: framework.validation.input

# Safety Validation
~ kind: constraint
~ order: 66
~ from: provider
~ provider: framework.validation.safety
~ when: security_context == "high" || compliance_level == "strict"

# Error Recovery Strategy
~ kind: constraint
~ order: 67
~ from: provider
~ provider: framework.error.recovery
~ when: debug_mode == "true" || retry_count > 1

# Tool Formatting Standards
~ kind: format
~ order: 68
~ from: provider
~ provider: framework.tool.formatting

# Advanced Provider Content
~ kind: task
~ order: 70
~ from: provider
~ provider: demo.advanced_provider
~ when: enable_advanced_features == "true"

# Context Provider Integration
~ kind: task
~ order: 71
~ from: provider
~ provider: demo.context_provider
~ when: enable_detailed_logging == "true"

# State Provider Integration
~ kind: task
~ order: 72
~ from: provider
~ provider: demo.state_provider
~ when: debug_mode == "true"

# Analytics Provider Integration
~ kind: task
~ order: 73
~ from: provider
~ provider: demo.analytics_provider
~ when: enable_experimental_mode == "true"

# Complex Conditional Logic
~ kind: task
~ order: 75
~ when: (enable_advanced_features == "true" && debug_mode == "true") || (enable_experimental_mode == "true" && max_iterations > 3)

Advanced conditional logic demonstration:
- Multiple conditions combined with AND/OR
- Nested boolean logic
- Variable comparison operations
- Runtime state evaluation

Current conditions met:
- Advanced features: {enable_advanced_features}
- Debug mode: {debug_mode}
- Experimental mode: {enable_experimental_mode}
- Max iterations: {max_iterations}

# Performance Optimization
~ kind: task
~ order: 80
~ when: max_concurrent_operations > 5 && memory_limit_mb >= 1024

Performance optimization enabled:
- Concurrency: {max_concurrent_operations} operations
- Memory: {memory_limit_mb}MB limit
- CPU: {cpu_quota}% quota
- Timeout: {timeout_setting}s per operation

# Security and Compliance
~ kind: constraint
~ order: 85
~ when: compliance_level == "strict" || security_context == "high"

Security requirements for {compliance_level} compliance:
- Authentication: {auth_token}
- Encryption: {encryption_key}
- Audit logging: {audit_required}
- Database security: {database_url}
- API security: {api_endpoint}

# Complex Output Format
~ kind: format
~ order: 90

## Executive Summary
- Task: {user_task}
- Project: {project_name}
- Language: {workspace_language}
- Paradigms: {tags.paradigm}
- Agents: {tags.agent}

## Technical Analysis
- Configuration: {enable_advanced_features} advanced, {enable_experimental_mode} experimental
- Performance: {max_concurrent_operations} concurrent, {memory_limit_mb}MB memory
- Security: {security_context} context, {compliance_level} compliance
- Operations: {max_iterations} iterations, {retry_count} retries

## Execution Plan
1. Initialize all paradigm-specific providers
2. Validate input and security constraints
3. Execute task using selected paradigms
4. Monitor performance and compliance
5. Generate comprehensive output

## Results and Metrics
- Execution time: [to be populated by providers]
- Resources used: [to be populated by providers]
- Compliance status: [to be populated by providers]
- Quality metrics: [to be populated by providers]

# Final Validation
~ kind: constraint
~ order: 95
~ locked: true

All operations must comply with:
- Framework version {framework_version}
- {security_level} security standards
- {compliance_level} compliance requirements
- Variable interpolation rules
- Provider integration protocols

# Completion and Cleanup
~ kind: task
~ order: last
~ when: user_task != "(no task specified)"

Task "{user_task}" completed for project "{project_name}" in {workspace_language} environment. All paradigm integrations tested and validated. Advanced features: {enable_advanced_features}, Experimental mode: {enable_experimental_mode}, Debug mode: {debug_mode}.

Cleanup operations:
- Release resources (memory: {memory_limit_mb}MB)
- Close connections (database: {database_url})
- Clear cache (endpoint: {cache_endpoint})
- Archive logs (detailed: {enable_detailed_logging})
